Z||000004||mbramble||09-30-2001||01:52 PM||||It is mounted in front of the motor on the headlight assembly.  Follow the green and gray wires that come out of the motor.  To see if it is the relay you can swap it with the one from the other headlight.  You can't get one from RS.||||reg||1
Z||000005||2farnorth||10-01-2001||06:11 AM||||When one of mine did that it turned out to be a bad gear in the motor.||||reg||1
